f Cairn: Mathair's Curse is inspired by life in the Scottish Highlands in the early 2000s. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/81b8ed615be257205ca1f2de8388be41.poster.avif?t=1750151052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/81b8ed615be257205ca1f2de8388be41.webm?t=1750151052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/81b8ed615be257205ca1f2de8388be41.mp4?t=1750151052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fight unusual and wacky enemies, including wild roaming haggis', bewildered stop signs and an odd group of cultists bent on destroying the world. Use character unique skills to tip the balance and unleash devastation on your foes and combine the skills of your friends to tactically defeat your enemies. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/73274b4123ccb2d095758e3056b85266.poster.avif?t=1750151052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/73274b4123ccb2d095758e3056b85266.webm?t=1750151052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1302530/extras/73274b4123ccb2d095758e3056b85266.mp4?t=1750151052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A soundtrack hand-crafted for the world of Cairn: Mathair's Curse - from bouncing combat music to spooky exploration ambience and heart-breaking melodies.",
